Package: iQualityR.stat
Title: Statistical Foundation for iQualityR
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Provides foundational statistical tools for the iQualityR ecosystem,
    including descriptive statistics, probability distributions (16+ types),
    standard deviation estimation (7 methods per ASTM E2587), SPC control chart
    constants, and statistical result interpretation. Designed as the statistical
    infrastructure layer for iQualityR business packages (capa, msa, doe, sampling,
    reliability, predict).
